---
config:
  flowchart:
    useMaxWidth: false
    wrappingWidth: 460
    nodeSpacing: 24
    rankSpacing: 36
---
flowchart TB
    A["pipeline --cadence X<br/>[--datasets a,b] [--terms …]"] --> B["registry.py：選出資料集<br/>(未給 --datasets = 該 cadence 全部)"]
    REG["<b>登錄表 DATASETS</b>：資料集 · cadence · 學期規則 → 寫入<br/>calendar · daily · calendar → calendar/*、{term}/calendar.json<br/>catalog · daily · active → catalog.ndjson · classes.json · 人數快照<br/>mprograms · daily · active → {term}/mprograms.json<br/>details · weekly · current → {term}/details.ndjson<br/>standards · weekly · none → standards/*.json<br/><b>rooms · weekly · active → {term}/rooms.json</b><br/>enrollment · season · current → 人數快照 + 觀測紀錄"]
    REG -.-|讀| B
    B --> C{{"逐資料集：學期規則"}}
    C -->|"有 --terms"| T0["用指定學期<br/>(expand_terms, 支援 a:b)"]
    C -->|"active"| T1["ACTIVE_TERMS 有值 = 照它<br/>未設 = current-term<br/>∪ 30 天內有選課窗口的學期"]
    C -->|"current"| T2["current-term"]
    C -->|"calendar / none"| T3["跑一次<br/>(_global)"]
    T0 --> F
    T1 --> F
    T2 --> F
    T3 --> F
    F["fetcher(ctx, term)<br/>只寫 canonical · 回報 files / failed_nodes"] --> G{{"成功?"}}
    G -->|是| OK["pipeline-result: ok + checked_at"]
    G -->|否| NG["pipeline-result: 錯誤摘要<br/>(不中斷其他資料集)"]
    OK --> R["結束碼 0 / 1<br/>stage 交給上鎖的 merge"]
    NG --> R

    classDef crawl fill:#bfdbfe,stroke:#1e40af,color:#000
    classDef done fill:#bbf7d0,stroke:#15803d,color:#000
    classDef bad fill:#fecaca,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#000
    classDef reg fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#4b5563,color:#000,text-align:left
    class F crawl
    class OK,R done
    class NG bad
    class REG reg
